      "content": "hey my son just got some amoxicillin for his ear infection but im so confused with the math. hes 15kg. the bottle says 400mg/5ml. the doctor said he needs 40mg per kg per day but i dont know how many ml to actually give him or how often. can u help me figure out the dose?",
